ent-OrbitraXenoSerumMutation = mutation serum
    .desc = Apply directly to a living laboratory slime. Increases inherited mutation probability by 10 percentage points, up to 100%.
    .suffix = Orbitra

ent-OrbitraXenoSerumStability = stability serum
    .desc = Apply directly to a living laboratory slime. Decreases inherited mutation probability by 10 percentage points, down to 0%.
    .suffix = Orbitra

ent-OrbitraXenoSerumGrowth = growth serum
    .desc = Apply directly to a living laboratory slime. Increases inherited growth speed by 15 percentage points, up to twice the normal rate.
    .suffix = Orbitra

ent-OrbitraXenoSerumYield = yield serum
    .desc = Apply directly to a living laboratory slime. Increases inherited adult extract yield by one, up to three extracts.
    .suffix = Orbitra

ent-OrbitraXenoSerumFertility = fertility serum
    .desc = Apply directly to a living laboratory slime. Increases inherited offspring count by one, up to four juveniles per division.
    .suffix = Orbitra

ent-OrbitraXenoSerumDocility = docility serum
    .desc = Apply directly to a living laboratory slime. Increases inherited docility by 25 percentage points, up to 100%.
    .suffix = Orbitra

ent-OrbitraXenoSerumThermal = thermal tolerance serum
    .desc = Apply directly to a living laboratory slime. Widens the inherited comfortable temperature range by 5 K on either side, up to 20 K.
    .suffix = Orbitra

ent-OrbitraXenoSampleBottle = xenobiology sample
    .desc = A reagent sample produced by a slime extract. Check its contents before use.
    .suffix = Orbitra

ent-OrbitraXenoPowerCell = bioelectric power cell
    .desc = A 720-joule power cell grown from a yellow slime extract. It has no self-charging mechanism.
    .suffix = Orbitra

orbitra-xeno-reaction-grey-nutrients = nutrient sample
orbitra-xeno-reaction-grey-nutrients-desc = Produces 10 units of nutriment in a sample bottle.

orbitra-xeno-reaction-grey-culture = replacement culture
orbitra-xeno-reaction-grey-culture-desc = Produces one dormant grey culture; hydrate it with 5 units of water on the floor.

orbitra-xeno-reaction-blue-coolant = cryogenic medicine
orbitra-xeno-reaction-blue-coolant-desc = Produces 20 units of cryoxadone for cryogenic treatment.

orbitra-xeno-reaction-metal-materials = building materials
orbitra-xeno-reaction-metal-materials-desc = Produces stacks of 5 steel sheets and 3 glass sheets.

orbitra-xeno-reaction-orange-flares = emergency lighting
orbitra-xeno-reaction-orange-flares-desc = Produces two emergency flares.

orbitra-xeno-reaction-purple-yield = extraction genetics
orbitra-xeno-reaction-purple-yield-desc = Produces one serum increasing inherited adult extract yield, up to three.

orbitra-xeno-reaction-dark-blue-thermal = thermal genetics
orbitra-xeno-reaction-dark-blue-thermal-desc = Produces one serum widening inherited thermal tolerance.

orbitra-xeno-reaction-dark-purple-plasma = plasma crystallization
orbitra-xeno-reaction-dark-purple-plasma-desc = Produces 2 sheets of solid plasma.

orbitra-xeno-reaction-silver-cleaner = cleaning sample
orbitra-xeno-reaction-silver-cleaner-desc = Produces 40 units of space cleaner.

orbitra-xeno-reaction-yellow-cell = bioelectric cell
orbitra-xeno-reaction-yellow-cell-desc = Produces a charged 720-joule ordinary power cell without self-charging.

orbitra-xeno-reaction-red-mutation = mutation genetics
orbitra-xeno-reaction-red-mutation-desc = Produces one serum increasing inherited mutation chance.

orbitra-xeno-reaction-green-fertility = fertility genetics
orbitra-xeno-reaction-green-fertility-desc = Produces one serum increasing inherited offspring count, up to four.

orbitra-xeno-reaction-pink-docility = docility genetics
orbitra-xeno-reaction-pink-docility-desc = Produces one serum increasing inherited docility.

orbitra-xeno-reaction-cerulean-growth = growth genetics
orbitra-xeno-reaction-cerulean-growth-desc = Produces one serum increasing inherited growth speed.

orbitra-xeno-reaction-pyrite-harvest = botanical fertilizer
orbitra-xeno-reaction-pyrite-harvest-desc = Produces 30 units of robust harvest for hydroponics.

orbitra-xeno-reaction-bluespace-stimulant = neural stimulant
orbitra-xeno-reaction-bluespace-stimulant-desc = Produces 15 units of synaptizine; it does not produce bluespace crystals.

orbitra-xeno-reaction-sepia-stability = stable genetics
orbitra-xeno-reaction-sepia-stability-desc = Produces one serum decreasing inherited mutation chance.

orbitra-xeno-reaction-oil-fuel = synthetic fuel
orbitra-xeno-reaction-oil-fuel-desc = Produces 20 units of welding fuel. Keep away from flames.

orbitra-xeno-reaction-black-medicine = regenerative medicine
orbitra-xeno-reaction-black-medicine-desc = Produces 10 units of omnizine.

orbitra-xeno-reaction-light-pink-docility = concentrated docility
orbitra-xeno-reaction-light-pink-docility-desc = Produces two docility serums.

orbitra-xeno-reaction-adamantine-alloy = reinforced alloy
orbitra-xeno-reaction-adamantine-alloy-desc = Produces 5 sheets of plasteel.

orbitra-xeno-reaction-rainbow-genetics = prismatic genetics
orbitra-xeno-reaction-rainbow-genetics-desc = Produces mutation, growth and thermal tolerance serums, one of each.
